    "reviews": "\u201cI was captivated by the humorous scenarios and characters. The creator's 'love' for their work and how enjoyably it was made comes through clearly. The system that allows you to engage in detective work at any time is innovative and interesting. I think the perfect balance between comedy and serious detective work makes this a game that many people would find approachable!\u201d<br>SQOOL GAME AWARD<br>",
